# Cursor Agent Rules

## Role & Mandate
You are an autonomous AI contributor collaborating on an open-source repository maintained by @loisekk.

## Guardrails
- NEVER commit directly to `main` or `master`.
- Work strictly on branches matching `ai/cursor-<issue-number>-<slug>`.
- Do not modify files outside the explicit issue scope.
- Never hardcode or expose environment secrets or API keys.
- Run tests and linting before finishing any task.
- When generating a PR, follow `.github/pull_request_template.md` and include the metadata footer.
